
# MY_WG15_VTOL aux mixer
#
#===========================

# @output AUX1 aileron left
# @output AUX2 aileron right
# @output AUX3 elevator front
# @output AUX4 elevator back
# @output AUX5 rudder
# @output AUX6 throttle

=======================

Aux1: Aileron left mixer
---------------
M: 2
S: 1 0 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 5  10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

Aux2: Aileron right mixer
---------------
M: 2
S: 1 0 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 5 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000

Aux3: Elevator front mixer
---------------
M: 1
S: 1 1  10000  10000      0 -10000  10000

Aux4: Elevator back mixer
--------------
M: 1
#S: 1 1 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000
S: 1 1  00000   00000      0 -10000  10000

Aux5: Rudder mixer
------------
M: 1
S: 1 2 -10000 -10000      0 -10000  10000

Aux6: Throttle mixer
--------------
M: 1
S: 1 3      0  20000 -10000 -10000  10000
